# Beyond Infinity (jeuno 137): Prelude to Puissance not completed. A level 91 Warrior at level cap 95, the Limit Breaker
# held, MAX_LEVEL 99, Prelude to Puissance available (a fresh char): this quest's available check fails, and Prelude to
# Puissance's own wants Dormant Powers Dislodged completed: no section; the default 10045 (0, 0, 2, 0). Then Prelude to
# Puissance completed by a GM: 10045 (91, 1, 5, 0, 0).
lists RuludeGardens/Nomad_Moogle/onTrigger RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/10045
char zone=RuludeGardens pos=11.5,2.5,121.9 job=WAR lvl=91
levelcap 95
keyitem LimitBreaker
login
trigger Nomad_Moogle                    # Prelude to Puissance available: no section; the default 10045 (0, 0, 2, 0)
finish
quest Jeuno.PreludeToPuissance completed  # a GM
trigger Nomad_Moogle                    # 10045 (91, 1, 5, 0, 0)
finish option=0                         # nothing
